00:25:27.460 --> 00:25:29.720
And our base thoughts, so...
["On Hospital Time" playing in the background]

00:25:29.720 --> 00:25:32.600
And what a lot of people- and I appreciate art, because...

00:25:32.600 --> 00:25:36.220
a lot of people who don't like art sometimes don't understand...

00:25:36.340 --> 00:25:39.040
I-and you're more than allowed to just not like art.  That's totally fine.

00:25:39.040 --> 00:25:41.040
