00:25:41.160 --> 00:25:44.060
Or judge you for n-liking certain types of art,

00:25:44.200 --> 00:25:45.980
or not liking certain types of art.

00:25:45.980 --> 00:25:48.960
But, art in my mind, is about emotion.

00:25:48.960 --> 00:25:54.140
And, games being another form of art, is about connecting that emotion.

00:25:54.140 --> 00:25:58.120
And most games, in terms of, like emotion, they want to convey,

00:25:58.120 --> 00:26:00.900
you know, excitement and fun, a-and engagement.

00:26:01.040 --> 00:26:02.640
Those complex emotions.

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:05.400
But there are other emotions, on an entire different spectrum.

00:26:05.400 --> 00:26:09.580
And crafting an experience, that conveys those emotions...

00:26:09.740 --> 00:26:13.860
is often far harder than getting the baser ones that we're all used to.

00:26:14.240 --> 00:26:15.200
And the ones...

00:26:15.320 --> 00:26:17.920
that are even more complex to put into words...

