01:40:48.160 --> 01:40:50.160
[Joel]

01:41:41.180 --> 01:41:42.060
Mark: Man...

01:41:44.160 --> 01:41:44.920
I'm...

01:41:46.540 --> 01:41:48.420
I'm guessing that was...

01:41:51.020 --> 01:41:53.000
Telling that Joel died...?

01:41:54.220 --> 01:41:55.260
Possibly...?

01:41:57.900 --> 01:41:58.700
I dunno...

01:42:01.000 --> 01:42:01.820
What's that?

01:42:06.900 --> 01:42:08.900
[Ryan]

01:43:39.360 --> 01:43:41.220
Mark: Oh... man.

01:43:43.180 --> 01:43:45.180
*deep sigh*

01:43:46.120 --> 01:43:47.480
...It's weird...

01:43:52.480 --> 01:43:54.480
I-it's bizarre.

01:43:55.580 --> 01:43:56.360
You know...

01:43:57.000 --> 01:43:57.880
After...

01:43:58.600 --> 01:44:05.080
After all the struggle, after all the hope, after all the...the different ways of trying to rationalize what happens,

01:44:05.080 --> 01:44:08.080
You know, i-it is bizarre, because afterwards...

01:44:08.780 --> 01:44:09.580
You know-

01:44:09.580 --> 01:44:11.580
[Joel]

01:44:18.920 --> 01:44:20.920
Mark: Well, you got a lot of pancakes there.

01:44:24.060 --> 01:44:25.100
Heh... *laughs softly*

01:44:25.100 --> 01:44:27.100
[Joel]

