Mark: Nah...

01:44:32.440 --> 01:44:33.300
Ohh...

01:44:49.500 --> 01:44:50.480
Is this- Am I-?

01:44:51.200 --> 01:44:52.440
*laughs*

01:44:55.260 --> 01:44:57.120
Yep, I got da bubbles.

01:44:58.360 --> 01:44:59.040
Ah.

01:45:00.560 --> 01:45:02.600
